      "body": "Hi Abraham,\n\nAs the principal attorney at Abgin Law, you are the one who has to decide whether an AI-generated output is useful enough to rely on. That is why the lawyer-review step in the workflow I sent matters more to me than the speed claim.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nWould a concise case summary or a list of unanswered client questions be more useful to review? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
